<title>CHINA: New Asia Realty names new chairman.</title>
<headline>New Asia Realty names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Asia Realty and Trust Co, a subsidiary of Wheelock and Co Ltd, said on Thursday Gonzaga Li had been appointed as director and would be named as chairman after the next annual general meeting on September 22.</p>
<p>Li is chairman of Wheelock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Li would replace the current New Asia chairman John Lees, who will retire in September.</p>
<p>It also said Li would be appointed as chairman of Realty Development Corp Ltd, a New Asia subsidiary of which Lees is the current chairman, on September 18.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
